   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every sample opens behind a 2 ms GPU spin and a device all-reduce (DeepEP's bench_kineto order); the window opens at the barrier exit.\nPer sample: cross-rank MAX \u2192 the component, MIN \u2192 cross_rank_min_us, MAX \u2212 MIN \u2192 cross_rank_spread_us. 256 trials \u00d7 8 = 2048 samples.",
   "originalText": "Every sample opens behind a 2 ms GPU spin and a device all-reduce (DeepEP's bench_kineto order); the window opens at the barrier exit.\nPer sample: cross-rank MAX \u2192 the component, MIN \u2192 cross_rank_min_us, MAX \u2212 MIN \u2192 cross_rank_spread_us. 256 trials \u00d7 8 = 2048 samples.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
