   "text": "entry skew and launch latency\nstay outside the window.\nGraphed rows capture spin + AR\nin the graph before the first event.",
   "originalText": "entry skew and launch latency\nstay outside the window.\nGraphed rows capture spin + AR\nin the graph before the first event.",
