   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Dequantizes the received FP8 payload to the BF16 combine sends; it stands in for the expert GEMM. Hoisted out of roundtrip and both chains;\nmeasured only on eager rows whose stage does device work. Never summed into a total or compared across backends.",
   "originalText": "Dequantizes the received FP8 payload to the BF16 combine sends; it stands in for the expert GEMM. Hoisted out of roundtrip and both chains;\nmeasured only on eager rows whose stage does device work. Never summed into a total or compared across backends.",
